Z||000001||Homicidal||06-07-2000||08:40 PM||||Just so you guys know, I wanna take the plastic cover off, not really the internal grill.  But I DO want to clean it!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula||06-07-2000||09:06 PM||||I'm guessing its a coupe style taillight.  if it is a GT then dont reference to this.<P>take the black covers off<BR>take the screws out<BR>unhook the things from the light sockets<P>pull the assembly out<BR>to open......<BR>use a screwdriver to pry (slowly from inside to outside) the case open while ripping the weatherstripping out.  If you take your time and dont rush you shouldnt break anything.  The weather stripping is on there really tight and it takes a while to get off though.  also when you put it back together get some autozone sealant or something to replace the removed weatherstripping or youll go through a lot of bulbs.<P>the internal lense just pops out once its all undone.  If you want to convert to a circle typ lense then I recommend buying monkeymans taillight mod!<P>Pics of it below!!!||||reg||1
